{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>ChronoCap 將日常行事曆變成科幻時間軸，每個行程以懸浮的立體膠囊呈現，適合喜歡科幻視覺與互動式排程的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-134.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>立體膠囊行程一眼掌握</h2>\n<p>每個行程化作色彩鮮明的立體時間膠囊，點按即可爆開查看標題、時間與詳情；以單指滑動穿越日期、雙指旋轉及捏合縮放，操作流暢。程式提供省電與豐富視覺模式，智能時間尺會自動調整刻度間距，並可在時間軸新增、修改、複製或刪除行程，支援重複行程與提醒，亦會自動配合深色模式。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-289-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-290-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-291-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-292-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-293-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-294-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：ChronoCap</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/chronocap/id6780032348?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.222481+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T06:57:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:33.376711+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:33.376711+00:00","content_hash":"2876f9ee2076d1fcc51dccd0dbd9c1bd05d8c6c3ba1ecb5b41c8530dd3f2e4bb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}